{"title":"타임캡슐","artist":"다비치","date":"2026-09-08","sourceId":"15101264:007","sourceHash":"4fd6e4316881ceb2354af8fa64c3711b0e70e02a166f5faafe3857c576ee2a5b","duration":169.3,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":30.34,"end":44.2,"text":"어디까지 갔나요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":44.35,"end":48.7,"text":"또 어떤 어른이 됐나요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":48.97,"end":53.6,"text":"언젠가 내가 마주할 아주 먼 미래의 넌","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":53.89,"end":58.2,"text":"그 꿈을 이루나요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":58.52,"end":69.6,"text":"난 어디쯤에 온 걸까","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":69.83,"end":77.0,"text":"나도 모르고 왔단 말이야","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":77.34,"end":80.1,"text":"언제나 뭔갈 되뇌던 아주 먼 과거의 기억","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":80.34,"end":90.1,"text":"어떤 꿈을 꿨던 걸까 난","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":90.15,"end":96.7,"text":"먼지 쌓인 서랍과 남아있던","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":96.92,"end":106.5,"text":"그 작았던 꼬만 자라있어","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":106.73,"end":109.7,"text":"우리는 오늘 만난 거야","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":109.78,"end":116.8,"text":"다시 가 볼게 네 손을 잡은 채","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":117.13,"end":123.1,"text":"어디로 가 볼까요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":123.23,"end":126.3,"text":"어떤 삶이 되어볼까요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":126.65,"end":129.8,"text":"우리가 두 손 잡으면 다가올 미래에서","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":130.14,"end":135.2,"text":"무엇도 두렵지 않아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":135.37,"end":138.5,"text":"어디도 못 갔지만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":138.81,"end":144.2,"text":"웅크려 있었던 것 뿐이야","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":144.47,"end":148.6,"text":"이제 다시 툭툭 일어서","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":148.87,"end":158.9,"text":"한 걸음 두 걸음 널 믿고서 난 걸어갈 거야","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}